@startuml SD-2d
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-2d (Software level, CSMS billing) — No payment result after the 15-min expiry: querydr schedule, and a late payment\nPrecondition: top-up is pending · System view: AD-2 · State: STM-4
footer Owner: Lê Bảo Khang (WP5) · v2.2 · 23/11/2026 · names = CD-2 class diagram · right gate = Payment Gateway

participant "«component»\n<u>:TopUpService</u>" as TS
participant "«component»\n<u>:CreditLedgerService</u>" as CL
participant "«port»\n<u>:VnpayAdapter</u>" as VA

== Query schedule: expiresAt + 2, 15, 30, 45, 60 min (expiresAt = creation + 15 min), +75 min only if the 60-min query returns RC 94 ==
loop each slot while the top-up is still pending (DB-polled sweep: status = pending AND next_attempt_at <= now)
  [o-> TS ++ : onPendingTimeout(topUpId)
  TS -> TS : claim row (unfinished_claims + 1,\nnext_attempt_at = lease deadline)
  TS -> VA ++ : queryTransaction(ref) : status
  VA ->] : querydr [HTTPS]
  note right : {d ≤ 10 s}
  VA <--] : transaction status
  VA --> TS -- : status
  alt paid
    TS -> TS : pending → credited
    TS -> CL ++ : post(accountId, top_up, +amountVnd, topUpId)
    CL --> TS --
  else answered: not paid
    TS -> TS : pending → expired (final)
    TS ->>] : notify Driver (MSG26)
  else answer unclear and a slot is left
    TS -> TS : stay pending, next_attempt_at = next slot,\nunfinished_claims = 0
  else answer unclear and no slot left
    TS -> TS : pending → expired,\nexception_kind = unresolved_04 / unresolved_07
    TS ->>] : notify Driver (MSG26)
  end
  deactivate TS
end
note over TS, VA : If the worker cannot finish a check 5 times in a row (claim limit), the 6th claim makes the top-up expired with exception_kind = retry_exhausted, listed for the Admin on Billing Exceptions.

== Notification arrives for an expired or failed top-up ==
[-> TS ++ : applyPaymentResult(ipn)  (from VnpayIpnController, SD-2b)
TS -> TS : record late payment (not credited, no invoice),\ntop-up stays expired / failed
TS ->>] : list on Billing Exceptions for an Admin refund (SD-2e)
[<-- TS -- : 00
@enduml
